   "source": [
    "# Consumer360 — Week 1 Data Foundation Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "A read-only audit of the Week 1 deliverables: source data reconciliation, PostgreSQL staging, data quality signals, transaction classification, star schema, referential integrity, Single Customer View, repository SQL assets, and historical SQL performance evidence.\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook does not modify source files or database objects. It uses the project's existing local configuration where available. Missing prerequisites are reported in the audit results; they do not require manual notebook edits.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "82642444",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Scope and reported baseline\n",
    "\n",
    "Reference values from `Consumer360_Week1_Completion_and_Details.docx`:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Measure | Reported value |\n",
    "|---|---:|\n",
    "| 2009–10 source rows | 525,461 |\n",
    "| 2010–11 source rows | 541,910 |\n",
    "| Cross-file matching occurrences | 22,523 |\n",
    "| Staging / fact rows | 1,044,848 |\n",
    "| `dim_customer` rows including unknown | 5,943 |\n",
    "| `dim_product` rows including unknown | 5,305 |\n",
    "| Identified customers in Single Customer View | 5,942 |\n",
    "| Merchandise purchasers | 5,852 |\n",
    "| Customers without merchandise orders | 90 |\n",
    "| SCV merchandise revenue | £17,117,089.2970 |\n",
    "| SQL performance target | under 2,000 ms |\n",
    "\n",
    "The report says overlap was excluded from the second source file only; within-file duplicates were preserved. Source files were not modified."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
